{"content_hash": "b9c4ceaf36af5635", "version_id": 628, "article_id": 63, "level_code": "ja_n3", "lang": "ja", "level": 3, "level_label": "N3 中級", "title": "ゲーム「サイバーパンク2077」が実写映画に、パラマウントが制作へ", "title_zh": "游戏《赛博朋克2077》要拍真人电影，派拉蒙负责制作", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "bbc_culture", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c60e048r02lgo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580617971627-cffa74e39d1d?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8dmlkZW8lMjBnYW1lJTIwY3liZXJwdW5rfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE3NjYwNDJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Jezael Melgoza on Unsplash", "author": "Jezael Melgoza", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@jezar?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-sitting-on-chair-in-front-of-table-2xBb36ebevg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(88, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(126, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "dbb883523716"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-12", "word_count": 217, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "大ヒットゲーム「サイバーパンク2077」が、ハリウッドで実写映画になります。制作するのはパラマウント・ピクチャーズで、ゲームを作った会社も一緒に進めます。", "lead_zh": "大热游戏《赛博朋克2077》要在好莱坞拍成真人电影了。负责制作的是派拉蒙影业，做这款游戏的公司也会一起参与。", "preview": "パラマウントは、映画「トランスフォーマー」で知られるプロデューサーのロレンゾ・ディ・ボナベンチュラさんと、ゲーム会社CDプロジェクト・レッド（CDPR）と一緒に映画を作ると発表しました。CDPRのミハウ・ノヴァコフスキ最高経営責任者は「パラマウントは私たちと同じ夢を持つパートナー", "preview_zh": "派拉蒙宣布，将与因电影《变形金刚》而闻名的制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉，以及游戏公司CD Projekt Red（CDPR）一起制作这部电影。CDPR的联席首席执行官米哈乌·诺瓦科夫斯基表示：“派拉蒙和我们怀着同样的梦想，所以非常期待。”", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 616, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/63/ja_n3.mp3", "duration": 43.725, "size_bytes": 266112, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 127, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@aa22245/content/data/versions/628.json", "paragraphs": ["パラマウントは、映画「トランスフォーマー」で知られるプロデューサーのロレンゾ・ディ・ボナベンチュラさんと、ゲーム会社CDプロジェクト・レッド（CDPR）と一緒に映画を作ると発表しました。CDPRのミハウ・ノヴァコフスキ最高経営責任者は「パラマウントは私たちと同じ夢を持つパートナーなので、とても楽しみです」と話しています。", "しかし、物語の中身や公開日、出演する俳優はまだ決まっていません。ゲーム「サイバーパンク2077」は2020年に発売されましたが、最初は問題が多くて評判がよくありませんでした。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["派拉蒙宣布，将与因电影《变形金刚》而闻名的制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉，以及游戏公司CD Projekt Red（CDPR）一起制作这部电影。CDPR的联席首席执行官米哈乌·诺瓦科夫斯基表示：“派拉蒙和我们怀着同样的梦想，所以非常期待。”", "不过，故事内容、上映日期和演员阵容都还没有确定。游戏《赛博朋克2077》2020年发售，最初问题很多、评价不好。即便如此，目前全球销量已超过4000万份。"], "body": "パラマウントは、映画「トランスフォーマー」で知られるプロデューサーのロレンゾ・ディ・ボナベンチュラさんと、ゲーム会社CDプロジェクト・レッド（CDPR）と一緒に映画を作ると発表しました。CDPRのミハウ・ノヴァコフスキ最高経営責任者は「パラマウントは私たちと同じ夢を持つパートナーなので、とても楽しみです」と話しています。\n\nしかし、物語の中身や公開日、出演する俳優はまだ決まっていません。ゲーム「サイバーパンク2077」は2020年に発売されましたが、最初は問題が多くて評判がよくありませんでした。", "body_zh": "派拉蒙宣布，将与因电影《变形金刚》而闻名的制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉，以及游戏公司CD Projekt Red（CDPR）一起制作这部电影。CDPR的联席首席执行官米哈乌·诺瓦科夫斯基表示：“派拉蒙和我们怀着同样的梦想，所以非常期待。”\n\n不过，故事内容、上映日期和演员阵容都还没有确定。游戏《赛博朋克2077》2020年发售，最初问题很多、评价不好。即便如此，目前全球销量已超过4000万份。", "text": "パラマウントは、映画「トランスフォーマー」で知られるプロデューサーのロレンゾ・ディ・ボナベンチュラさんと、ゲーム会社CDプロジェクト・レッド（CDPR）と一緒に映画を作ると発表しました。CDPRのミハウ・ノヴァコフスキ最高経営責任者は「パラマウントは私たちと同じ夢を持つパートナーなので、とても楽しみです」と話しています。 しかし、物語の中身や公開日、出演する俳優はまだ決まっていません。ゲーム「サイバーパンク2077」は2020年に発売されましたが、最初は問題が多くて評判がよくありませんでした。", "vocab": [{"word": "実写映画", "pos": "noun", "zh": "真人电影", "note": "与动画相对，指由真人出演的电影", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "制作", "pos": "noun", "zh": "制作", "note": "する动词，表示拍电影、做作品", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "発表", "pos": "noun", "zh": "发布、宣布", "note": "する动词，新闻中常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "最高経営責任者", "pos": "noun", "zh": "首席执行官（CEO）", "note": "公司里职位最高的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "発売", "pos": "noun", "zh": "发售、上市", "note": "する动词，用于商品、游戏", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "評判", "pos": "noun", "zh": "评价、口碑", "note": "「評判がいい／悪い」很常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "設定", "pos": "noun", "zh": "设定", "note": "故事或角色的背景安排", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "陰謀", "pos": "noun", "zh": "阴谋", "note": "秘密的计划，常用于故事", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "追加作品", "pos": "noun", "zh": "追加内容、资料片", "note": "在原有游戏上加的新内容", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "部門", "pos": "noun", "zh": "部门", "note": "公司内部的一个组织", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "合併", "pos": "noun", "zh": "合并", "note": "する动词，两家公司变成一家", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "心配", "pos": "noun", "zh": "担心", "note": "する动词，「心配する」表示担忧", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Video game Cyberpunk 2077 to get live-action movie adaptation", "summary_original": "The smash hit from the studio behind The Witcher series is to be turned into a film by Paramount Pictures.", "body_original": "Video game Cyberpunk 2077 to get live-action movie adaptation\nBy\nTom Richardson\nBBC Newsbeat\nPublished\n9 October 2026\nA live-action movie version of smash hit video game Cyberpunk 2077 is being developed by Paramount Pictures.\nThe Hollywood studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, known for his work on the Transformers films, and CD Projekt Red (CDPR), the developer of the sci-fi role-playing game.\nCDPR's joint-chief executive Michał Nowakowski said in a statement\n,\nexternal\nthe company was \"excited about Paramount as a future partner who shares our creative ambitions for the Cyberpunk franchise\".\nDetails of the film's story, potential release date and casting information are yet to be revealed.\nDespite\na troubled launch in 2020\n, the Cyberpunk 2077 video game, which stars Keanu Reeves, has sold more than 40 million copies worldwide.\nThe John Wick star plays rockstar Johnny Silverhand, a terrorist whose consciousness is stored on a chip inside the body of main character V.\nSet in Night City, a fictional metropolis in a dystopian version of California, players work to uncover a conspiracy involving the shady Arasaka megacorporation.\nAn expansion, Phantom Liberty,\nstarring Idris Elba was released in 2023\nand has sold more than 15 million copies, according to CDPR.\nCyberpunk has already been successfully adapted into a popular animated series - Edgerunners - with a second season due to premiere on Netflix later this month.\nThe streamer also produced The Witcher, an adaptation of CDPR's massively popular fantasy role-playing series.\nIt originally starred former Superman actor Henry Cavill, but he was\nreplaced by Liam Hemsworth in the show's fourth season.\nMultiple video game series have been adapted for TV and film in recent years, with more due to follow.\nTwo Super Mario movies, a big screen version of Minecraft and a series of Sonic the Hedgehog films have each seen global box office takings of about $1bn.\nPlayStation game The Last of Us was made into a hit series by HBO, and Prime Video says its adaptation of post-apocalyptic role-playing series Fallout is one of its most-watched programmes.\nXbox maker Microsoft announced this week\n,\nexternal\nit had created a new \"XP\" division to focus on licensing its games for films, theme parks and other tie-ins.\nEarlier this week, Paramount Skydance completed\nits $110bn (£82.8bn) merger\nwith Warner Bros Discovery.\nIt's promised to release 30 films annually for the next two years, but also prompted\nfears over job losses and price rises for streaming services\nsuch as HBO Max and Paramount+.\nAdditional reporting by Peter Gillibrand.\nListen to Newsbeat\nlive\nat 12:45 and 17:45 weekdays - or listen back\nhere\n.\nRelated topics\nGaming", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:47:20.989997", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "パラマウント", "s": 0.163, "e": 0.812, "sm": 162, "em": 812, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "は", "s": 0.825, "e": 1.112, "sm": 825, "em": 1112, "cs": 6, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "、", "s": 1.112, "e": 1.413, "sm": 1112, "em": 1412, "cs": 7, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "映画", "s": 1.413, "e": 1.738, "sm": 1412, "em": 1737, "cs": 8, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "「", "s": 1.738, "e": 1.975, "sm": 1737, "em": 1975, "cs": 10, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "トランス", "s